/*!
\page p_deprecation Deprecation

Although, the RWMath library is a fairly new system, it stills carries with it
a lot of legacy API's.  (See the \ref p_history "history" page for more
information.)  In an attempt to keep the libraries API clean, we have marked
some API's as deprecated.  Deprecated functions are code that we support for
legacy reasons, but we feel users should avoid using.  In the future we would
like to drop support for this functionality entirely.

The RW_MATH_ENABLE_DEPRECATED_API define is used to control whether or not the
old deprecated functionality is supported.  By default
RW_MATH_ENABLE_DEPRECATED_API is set to 1.  This define enables support for the
deprecated API.  If you would like to avoid using deprecated functionality,
please define RW_MATH_ENABLE_DEPRECATED_API to
0 before including any rwmath headers. 

    
*/
